  "proTips": [
    "Lock Master Volume with padlock for consistent preview across presets",
    "Alt + Click any macro to reset to designer's intended default",
    "Check Vectorscope for bass - MUST show vertical line (mono)",
    "Use 'Warming' limiter mode with 30% Pre for instant analog character",
    "High Pass non-bass sounds at 180Hz using Master Filter for mix clarity",
    "Automate macros for movement - static presets sound boring",
    "Use 'Dump Score' on loop presets (orange icon) to extract MIDI",
    "Double-click FLEX logo to cycle through color themes"
  ],

